Note that ?plot won't help; you need to check ?plot.network

Check out the following example, which may help:

  data(g4)
  colors <- rep(c("green","red","blue"), c(1, 2, 1))
  sizes <- rep(c(2.0, 2.5, 3.0), c(2, 1, 1))
  nsides <- rep(c(3, 4, 8), c(1, 1, 2))
  plot(g4, vertex.col=colors, vertex.cex=sizes, vertex.sides=nsides)


