Dear All,

I am trying to find the probability of a node i reaching a node j in k  
steps for a directed network of size n, given that I have already  
identified an appropriate and non-degenerate model.
This what i did as a test.
m <- matrix(rbinom(n^2,1,.6),n,n);diag(m) <- 0;g <- network(m, directed=T)
