From dhunter at stat.psu.edu  Sat Apr 24 07:23:24 2010
From: dhunter at stat.psu.edu (David Hunter)
Date: Sat Apr 24 07:23:24 2010
Subject: [statnet_help] adding vertex attribute and summary for
	mutual(attrname)
