Hi Saeed,

update_statnet is a complex piece of code as it tries to detach packages as it installs.
Alas, it is not guaranteed to work on all systems and all the time.

However, direct methods can be applied. In particular, to install "netperm" you can use

install.packages("netperm",contriburl="http://csde.washington.edu/statnet")

Mark

